//cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250831/1038771025166209024124035.jpeg/Bbd7VoVnbl44fZm7CbJUWNTfCjwg3d54GPXxshj18bI\"/><figcaption>CEO揭見工求職面試「3大死亡陷阱」！如曾因裁員離職切勿這樣說（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"美國史登商學院教授、暢銷作家暨CEO威爾奇（IG@suzywelch）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250831/1038771030321270784145796.jpeg/XN0vdLnnQew7yU2_-sdj7o4Eh9s5FzDVjU6EhI1OhIQ\"/><figcaption>美國史登商學院教授、暢銷作家暨CEO威爾奇（IG@suzywelch）</figcaption></figure><p>台中最潮廁所！她如廁見男女標示「跑動換位」焦急 設計用意曝光</p><p>冷氣26度開風扇是白花電費？實測結果曝：壓縮機耗電高十倍</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-09T08:39:09.285035+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1634,"images":31,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}